abstract: >-
  Exact fiber-elimination identities and a local geometric reconstruction,
  with computational audits and finite floating-point reconnaissance.
  No fixed parameter pair or parameter region is interval-certified.
  This version corrects the reflection/domain reconstruction in Figure 2,
  completes the documented data and figure generators, and preserves the
  central identities and all 112 phase-map sign classifications.
